{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1765176305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1765176305 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Kingcrab Simulator</strong> is a third-person destruction action (semi) open-world adventure game where you become a mighty king crab, liberate countless kidnapped crabs, and lay waste to major cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a giant and powerful Super Kingcrab\u2014smash buildings, destroy crab restaurants, and rescue your fellow crabs.</strong><br>Progress through the chaos and ultimately destroy the cities to escape the world of humanity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1765176305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1765176305 width=800 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.poster.avif?t=1765176305\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.webm?t=1765176305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.mp4?t=1765176305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the most powerful of all king crabs \u2014 the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy buildings and strip humans of their shelters!<br>Rip out the ruins and hurl them to devastate nearby towns and cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are so many targets around you waiting to be destroyed...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1765176305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1765176305 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.poster.avif?t=1765176305\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.webm?t=1765176305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.mp4?t=1765176305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't destroy buildings and fight humans all by yourself...<br><strong>Because a king crab is never alone. There are many of you\u2014many crabs!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You <strong>must</strong> liberate the others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crabs will fight by your side\u2026<br>Free one crab, and it will help you free more.<br>Work together to liberate even more king crabs somewhere out there\u2026!!<br>And together, let's bring total ruin to this hellish world!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1765176305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1765176305 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's a great question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist\u2026 the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>, <br>set out on a journey after noticing that many of his kind were mysteriously disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But during his journey, he witnessed something truly horrifying\u2026</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/b710565ff961001e0418a965cbeb4ff3.avif?t=1765176305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/b710565ff961001e0418a965cbeb4ff3.avif?t=1765176305 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A city where humans were eating king crabs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, our king crab has a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent more crabs from being devoured, he must destroy the crab restaurants.<br>And he must annihilate the cities of the humans who feasted on his kin \u2014 by any means necessary.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Building 50% Sale!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773390/da4514f86bdb54174c3225c1f77daed2c9bc2d5b.jpg"},{"name":"Building 100% Sale!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773390/78803ef38c813a15cd981807d4074ab83a36ac33.jpg"},{"name":"Building 360% Sale??","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3773390/c53c972afbdd10324f76cd20107b704f3b366158.jpg"},{